{"seq":1,"slug":"compose-file-anatomy","title":"Compose 文件解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/compose-file-anatomy","wordCount":863,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-文件解析\">Compose 文件解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 文件是一份 YAML <strong>声明式配置</strong>，描述多容器应用的期望形态。三个核心顶级键：<strong>services</strong>（服务定义，每一项描述一个容器的完整运行规格）、<strong>networks</strong>（自定义网络拓扑）、<strong>volumes</strong>（命名数据卷）。</p>\n<p>每个服务有两种镜像来源：<code>image</code> 使用现成镜像，<code>build</code> 从 Dockerfile 构建。配置注入以环境变量为主，按五级优先级覆盖；Compose V2 推荐使用 <code>compose.yaml</code> 文件名与 <code>docker compose</code> 命令格式。声明式的意义在于：整份文件即环境定义，可纳入版本控制并一键重建。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件结构概览\">文件结构概览</h2><p>Docker Compose 使用 YAML 格式的声明式配置文件描述多容器应用。从 Compose V2 开始，推荐使用 <code>compose.yaml</code> 作为默认文件名，取代旧的 <code>docker-compose.yml</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: myproject&#10;&#10;services:&#10;  web:&#10;    image: nginx:alpine&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;8080:80&#39;&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./html:/usr/share/nginx/html:ro&#10;    networks:&#10;      - frontend&#10;&#10;  api:&#10;    build:&#10;      context: ./api&#10;      dockerfile: Dockerfile&#10;    environment:&#10;      DATABASE_URL: postgres://user:pass@db:5432/mydb&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      db:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;    networks:&#10;      - frontend&#10;      - backend&#10;&#10;  db:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    environment:&#10;      POSTGRES_DB: mydb&#10;      POSTGRES_USER: user&#10;      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: pass&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD-SHELL&#39;, &#39;pg_isready -U user&#39;]&#10;      interval: 10s&#10;      timeout: 5s&#10;      retries: 5&#10;    networks:&#10;      - backend&#10;&#10;volumes:&#10;  pgdata:&#10;&#10;networks:&#10;  frontend:&#10;  backend:\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myproject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8080:80'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./html:/usr/share/nginx/html:ro</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      dockerfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Dockerfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      DATABASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres://user:pass@db:5432/mydb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mydb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_USER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD-SHELL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pg_isready -U user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pgdata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  frontend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  backend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顶级键</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>项目名称</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>services</td>\n<td>定义应用的各个服务</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>networks</td>\n<td>定义自定义网络</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volumes</td>\n<td>定义命名数据卷</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>configs</td>\n<td>定义配置对象</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>secrets</td>\n<td>定义敏感数据</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph compose.yaml&#10;        S[services] --&gt; S1[web]&#10;        S --&gt; S2[api]&#10;        S --&gt; S3[db]&#10;        N[networks] --&gt; N1[frontend]&#10;        N --&gt; N2[backend]&#10;        V[volumes] --&gt; V1[pgdata]&#10;        S1 -.-&gt; N1&#10;        S2 -.-&gt; N1&#10;        S2 -.-&gt; N2&#10;        S3 -.-&gt; N2&#10;        S3 -.-&gt; V1&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph compose.yaml\n        S[services] --&gt; S1[web]\n        S --&gt; S2[api]\n        S --&gt; S3[db]\n        N[networks] --&gt; N1[frontend]\n        N --&gt; N2[backend]\n        V[volumes] --&gt; V1[pgdata]\n        S1 -.-&gt; N1\n        S2 -.-&gt; N1\n        S2 -.-&gt; N2\n        S3 -.-&gt; N2\n        S3 -.-&gt; V1\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务配置详解\">服务配置详解</h2><p>每个 service 定义了一个容器的完整运行规格，包括镜像来源、端口映射、环境变量等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"构建配置\">构建配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  app:&#10;    build:&#10;      context: .&#10;      dockerfile: Dockerfile.prod&#10;      target: runtime&#10;      args:&#10;        NODE_ENV: production&#10;      cache_from:&#10;        - type=registry,ref=registry.example.com/myapp:cache&#10;    platform: linux/amd64\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      dockerfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Dockerfile.prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">runtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      cache_from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type=registry,ref=registry.example.com/myapp:cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">linux/amd64</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"资源限制\">资源限制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  worker:&#10;    image: myworker:latest&#10;    deploy:&#10;      resources:&#10;        limits:&#10;          cpus: &#39;2.0&#39;&#10;          memory: 1G&#10;        reservations:&#10;          cpus: &#39;0.5&#39;&#10;          memory: 256M&#10;      replicas: 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myworker:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    deploy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        reservations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">256M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务配置项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>image</td>\n<td>使用的镜像</td>\n<td>nginx:alpine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>build</td>\n<td>构建配置</td>\n<td>context + dockerfile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ports</td>\n<td>端口映射</td>\n<td>&quot;8080:80&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>environment</td>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td>KEY: value</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>env_file</td>\n<td>环境变量文件</td>\n<td>.env</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volumes</td>\n<td>数据卷挂载</td>\n<td>./data:/app/data</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>depends_on</td>\n<td>服务依赖</td>\n<td>支持条件等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>restart</td>\n<td>重启策略</td>\n<td>unless-stopped</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>command</td>\n<td>覆盖默认命令</td>\n<td>[&quot;node&quot;, &quot;server.js&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>entrypoint</td>\n<td>覆盖入口点</td>\n<td>[&quot;/docker-entrypoint.sh&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>env_file</code> 引用的 <code>.env</code> 文件不应提交到版本控制。推荐创建 <code>.env.example</code> 作为模板，在 <code>.gitignore</code> 中排除实际的 <code>.env</code> 文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"网络配置\">网络配置</h2><p>Compose 自动为每个项目创建一个默认的 bridge 网络，也可以自定义网络拓扑实现服务隔离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"networks:&#10;  frontend:&#10;    driver: bridge&#10;    ipam:&#10;      config:&#10;        - subnet: 172.28.0.0/16&#10;  backend:&#10;    driver: bridge&#10;    internal: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  frontend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bridge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ipam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">subnet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">172.28.0.0/16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  backend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bridge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    internal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 外部访问&#10;        CLIENT[客户端]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph frontend&#10;        WEB[web :8080]&#10;        API[api :3000]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph backend internal&#10;        API2[api]&#10;        DB[db :5432]&#10;        REDIS[redis :6379]&#10;    end&#10;    CLIENT --&gt; WEB&#10;    WEB --&gt; API&#10;    API2 --&gt; DB&#10;    API2 --&gt; REDIS&#10;    CLIENT -.-&gt;|不可达| DB\">graph TD\n    subgraph 外部访问\n        CLIENT[客户端]\n    end\n    subgraph frontend\n        WEB[web :8080]\n        API[api :3000]\n    end\n    subgraph backend internal\n        API2[api]\n        DB[db :5432]\n        REDIS[redis :6379]\n    end\n    CLIENT --&gt; WEB\n    WEB --&gt; API\n    API2 --&gt; DB\n    API2 --&gt; REDIS\n    CLIENT -.-&gt;|不可达| DB</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>driver</td>\n<td>网络驱动类型</td>\n<td>bridge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>internal</td>\n<td>禁止外部访问</td>\n<td>false</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>attachable</td>\n<td>允许手动附加容器</td>\n<td>false</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ipam</td>\n<td>IP 地址管理配置</td>\n<td>自动分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>labels</td>\n<td>网络元数据标签</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"环境变量与配置\">环境变量与配置</h2><p>Compose 支持多种环境变量注入方式，满足不同场景的配置需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    image: myapi:latest&#10;    environment:&#10;      - NODE_ENV=production&#10;      - LOG_LEVEL=${LOG_LEVEL:-info}&#10;    env_file:&#10;      - .env&#10;      - .env.local\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapi:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NODE_ENV=production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LOG_LEVEL=${LOG_LEVEL:-info}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    env_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.env.local</span></span></code></pre></div><p>变量优先级从高到低：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose run -e DEBUG=1 api&#10;&#10;docker compose --env-file .env.staging up&#10;&#10;docker compose config\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DEBUG=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --env-file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.staging</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>compose run -e</td>\n<td>运行时指定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>environment 字段</td>\n<td>compose.yaml 定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>env_file</td>\n<td>外部文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>宿主机环境变量</td>\n<td>Shell 环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>.env 文件</td>\n<td>默认环境文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>docker compose config</code> 命令可以查看变量替换后的最终配置，这是排查环境变量问题的有效手段。变量支持 <code>${VAR:-default}</code> 语法设置默认值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"compose-命令速查\">Compose 命令速查</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose up -d&#10;&#10;docker compose down --volumes&#10;&#10;docker compose logs -f api&#10;&#10;docker compose ps&#10;&#10;docker compose exec api sh&#10;&#10;docker compose build --no-cache&#10;&#10;docker compose pull&#10;&#10;docker compose restart api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> down</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --volumes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>常用选项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>up</td>\n<td>创建并启动服务</td>\n<td>-d, --build, --scale</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>down</td>\n<td>停止并移除容器和网络</td>\n<td>--volumes, --rmi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>logs</td>\n<td>查看服务日志</td>\n<td>-f, --tail</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ps</td>\n<td>列出运行中的服务</td>\n<td>-a</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exec</td>\n<td>在运行中的容器执行命令</td>\n<td>-T（非 TTY）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>build</td>\n<td>构建服务镜像</td>\n<td>--no-cache</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pull</td>\n<td>拉取服务镜像</td>\n<td>--ignore-buildable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>restart</td>\n<td>重启服务</td>\n<td>-t（超时秒数）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Compose 文件解析))&#10;    文件结构&#10;      services 服务&#10;      networks 网络&#10;      volumes 数据卷&#10;      configs 配置&#10;    服务配置&#10;      image / build&#10;      ports 端口&#10;      environment 环境变量&#10;      depends_on 依赖&#10;    网络配置&#10;      自定义网络&#10;      internal 内部网络&#10;      服务隔离&#10;    环境变量&#10;      多来源优先级&#10;      .env 文件&#10;      变量替换语法\">mindmap\n  root((Compose 文件解析))\n    文件结构\n      services 服务\n      networks 网络\n      volumes 数据卷\n      configs 配置\n    服务配置\n      image / build\n      ports 端口\n      environment 环境变量\n      depends_on 依赖\n    网络配置\n      自定义网络\n      internal 内部网络\n      服务隔离\n    环境变量\n      多来源优先级\n      .env 文件\n      变量替换语法</pre><ul>\n<li>Compose 文件使用 YAML 声明式语法，核心顶级键为 <code>services</code>、<code>networks</code> 和 <code>volumes</code>。</li>\n<li>服务配置支持 <code>image</code>（使用现有镜像）和 <code>build</code>（从 Dockerfile 构建）两种模式。</li>\n<li>网络配置通过 <code>internal: true</code> 可创建完全隔离的内部网络，外部流量无法到达。</li>\n<li>环境变量支持五级优先级覆盖，使用 <code>docker compose config</code> 验证最终配置。</li>\n<li>Compose V2 推荐使用 <code>compose.yaml</code> 文件名和 <code>docker compose</code> 命令格式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose 文件解析","id":"compose-文件解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文件结构概览","id":"文件结构概览"},{"level":2,"text":"服务配置详解","id":"服务配置详解"},{"level":3,"text":"构建配置","id":"构建配置"},{"level":3,"text":"资源限制","id":"资源限制"},{"level":2,"text":"网络配置","id":"网络配置"},{"level":2,"text":"环境变量与配置","id":"环境变量与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Compose 命令速查","id":"compose-命令速查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-networking"},"next":{"title":"多服务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/multi-service-orchestration"}}